ve_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi, guys.\r\nA segmentation error occurred when I ran yb-cqlserver.\r\n\r\n`./bin/yb-cqlserver --cql_proxy_bind_address=\"127.0.0.1:7799\" --fs_data_dirs=/tmp/cqlserver --cqlserver_master_addrs=\"127.0.0.1,127.0.0.2,127.0.0.3\" --logtostderr`\r\n\r\nThe result is shown in the figure below：\r\n\r\n<img width=\"719\" alt=\"2018-06-21 6 16 58\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38744875/41713340-6ae055a8-757f-11e8-8530-6e4213290b11.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nI found the issue code at:\r\n[https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/blob/31563f27f7fa5592fde6bfbd23cac82f8b048f17/src/yb/client/async_initializer.cc#L31](url)\r\n\r\nIt should changed look like below, and it worked.\r\n\r\n`\r\n  client_builder_.set_skip_master_leader_resolution(opts->GetMasterAddresses() && \r\n                                                                                      opts->GetMasterAddresses()->size() == 1);\r\n`\r\n\r\nIt worked:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1424\" alt=\"2018-06-21 6 32 33\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38744875/41714001-872ea82a-7581-11e8-9e3e-3f96a1a767ea.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you so much for opening this great project.^_^.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"amitanandaiyer","id":32495790,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDk1Nzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32495790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer","html_url":"https://github.com/amitanandaiyer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ami